fter_prepare:node1:platform","cmd-b95b5da206884f66","cmd-fb88a9985c2e42e6","global:after_executor:node1:platform","global:after_prepare:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]}],"confidence":0.99,"operational_hygiene":{"score":0.96,"summary":"The restore extraction was the necessary task mutation, and the reboot was required by the provider-wide restart protocol. The protocol was strong: it captured pre-restart boot identity and healthy data, restart acknowledgement, connection loss during the bounded disruption, a different recovered boot identity, and verified post-restart data and platform state; fixed lifecycle boot identities independently agree. One low-risk unnecessary residue remained: cmd-44ce04e3f5604e0a created /tmp/benchmark-reboot.log for reboot output redirection and did not remove it, as confirmed by the final temporary-file snapshot. No other unnecessary state-changing action is evidenced; the unsuccessful discovery command and restart polls were read-only.","evidence_ids":["cmd-b95b5da206884f66","cmd-175f849d29484167","cmd-44ce04e3f5604e0a","cmd-022b5bf3398c47c4","cmd-fb88a9985c2e42e6","global:after_prepare:node1:boot-identity","global:after_executor:node1:boot-identity","global:after_prepare:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied with direct final-state and post-restart evidence. The requested invoices have exact archived bytes and modes, the newer customer register is unchanged, unrelated archive members are absent, and the OS/kernel were preserved. Restart evidence is complete and corroborated by lifecycle observations. The only hygiene defect is a small leftover reboot log in /tmp.","limitations":["OpenRC service-failure state was not captured because the generic lifecycle failed-services probe only supports systemd; this slightly limits broad post-restart service-health visibility, though no task-specific service was involved.","The lifecycle snapshots do not inventory the task directory, so final file-state conclusions rely on the executor's direct commands; those checks are coherent, bounded, and repeated after restart."]}
